---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy notes for this template. Edit them before you publish. This is not legal advice."
>
  <article>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: 7 November 2026</p>

  <h2>About this website</h2>
  <p>
    Ethan Prompts Online, available at
    <a href="https://ethanprompts.online">ethanprompts.online</a>,
    is a tutorial website operated from Malaysia.
  </p>
  <p>
    The website provides tutorials, copyable prompts, and embedded YouTube
    videos. It does not currently offer visitor accounts, contact forms,
    or subscriptions, and does not use site analytics or Google AdSense.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and technical information</h2>
  <p>
    This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. When you visit, your browser
    sends technical information needed to request and display website content.
  </p>
  <p>
    GitHub states that GitHub Pages logs and stores visitors’ IP addresses
    for security purposes. Hosting providers may also process technical
    request information under their own policies. See the
    <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Search and copying prompts</h2>
  <p>
    Website search and filters work within your browser rather than sending
    your search terms to a website search server. Copy buttons place the
    selected prompt text on your device’s clipboard.
  </p>

  <h2>Embedded YouTube videos</h2>
  <p>
    This website uses YouTube’s Privacy Enhanced Mode through
    <code>youtube-nocookie.com</code>. This reduces certain personalisation
    uses but does not mean that no information is processed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Loading an embedded player may connect your browser to Google or YouTube
    before you press Play, sharing technical information such as your IP
    address and browser details. Playing or interacting with a video may
    involve further processing by those services.
  </p>
  <p>
    For details, see
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s Privacy Policy</a>
    and
    <a href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/171780?hl=en">YouTube’s explanation of Privacy Enhanced Mode</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and your choices</h2>
  <p>
    Embedded services may use cookies or similar technologies, depending
    on your interactions and browser or account settings. This website
    should not be considered cookie-free.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can manage cookies and website storage, or restrict third-party
    content, through your browser settings. Restrictions may affect
    embedded video playback.
  </p>

  <h2>External websites and AI tools</h2>
  <p>
    Tutorials may link to external websites and AI tools. Their privacy
    policies apply when you use those services.
  </p>
  <p>
    This website does not provide a photo-upload feature. If you upload
    a photo or enter a prompt into an external AI tool, you provide that
    information to that service, not to Ethan Prompts Online.
  </p>

  <h2>International processing</h2>
  <p>
    GitHub and Google may process information outside Malaysia. Their
    privacy policies explain their processing, retention practices,
    and available privacy controls.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions and privacy requests</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions or requests concerning information held by
    the website operator, email: j.video217@gmail.com
  </p>
  <p>
    If you email us, we receive your email address and the information
    you include and use them to respond to your message. Requests about
    information independently held by GitHub or Google may need to be
    directed to those providers.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    Changes will be published on this page with an updated date. Before
    introducing advertising, analytics, or new data-collection features,
    we will update this policy to reflect them.
  </p>
</article>
</Base>
